# Maiden of the Dusk (WotG 51) edges in the Walk of Echoes, from Status 4: the login plays 6; the update with option 5
# sends no update packet; the finish sets Status 5, and the next tick sets the char down at -700.063 -17.6 -331.903 rot
# 64. The login plays 7; the update with option 4 sends nothing; the finish sets Status 6. The login plays 8; the update
# with option 4 sends nothing; the finish sets Status 7. At Status 3 and at Status 0 (a GM) the rezone plays no zone-in
# event and the Ornate Door (_521) sends only the release.
lists GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrigger GraubergS/onEventFinish/38 GraubergS/onEventFinish/44 WalkOfEchoes/_521/onTrigger WalkOfEchoes/onZoneIn/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/6 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/7 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/8 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/4 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/5 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/6 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/7 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/8 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/9
char zone=WalkOfEchoes pos=-700.042,0.4,-441.301 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg MaidenOfTheDusk current
charvar Mission[5][50]Status 4
login open                                 # 6
update 6 option=5                          # not 6: no update packet
finish                                     # Status 5
tick 400
login open                                 # 7
update 7 option=4                          # not 5: no update packet
finish                                     # Status 6
tick 400
login open                                 # 8
update 8 option=4                          # not 5
finish                                     # Status 7
charvar Mission[5][50]Status 3
rezone                                     # Status 3: no zone-in event
trigger _521                               # Status 3: nothing
finish-if-event
charvar Mission[5][50]Status 0
rezone                                     # Status 0: no zone-in event
trigger _521                               # Status 0: nothing
finish-if-event
